[% INCLUDE start.gb %]

<h2>已有表格</h2>

<div id="accordion">[% FOREACH item=topics %]
  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-header" id="heading[% item.TABLE_NAME %]">
        <button class="btn btn-link btn-primary" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapse[% item.TABLE_NAME %]" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapse[% item.TABLE_NAME %]">
          [% item.TABLE_NAME %]
        </button>
 &nbsp; 角色表：[% IF item.is_role %]&check;[% ELSE %]&#10005;[% END %]， 分量：[% IF item.is_component %]&check;[% ELSE %]&#10005;[% END %]
    </div>

    <div id="collapse[% item.TABLE_NAME %]" class="collapse show" aria-labelledby="heading[% item.TABLE_NAME %]" data-parent="#accordion">
      <div class="card-body">
<pre><code>[% item.create_table %]</code></pre>
<a class="btn btn-sm btn-warning" href="database?action=delete&table_name=[% item.TABLE_NAME %]">删除</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>[% END %]
</div>

<h2>添加新表</h2>

<form class="form" action=database method=post>
<input type=hidden name=action value='insert'>
<div class=row>
	<div class="col-6">
		<div class=row>
			<div class="col-12">名称:</div>
		</div>
		<div class=row>
			<div class="col-12"><input type=text class="form-control" name=table_name placeholder="my_friend"></div>
		</div>
		<div class=row>
			<div class="col-12">SQL表格生成语句:</div>
		</div>
		<div class=row>
			<div class="col-12"><textarea class="form-control" name='statement' rows=12 placeholder="(
  fid int unsigned NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,
  user_id int unsigned NOT NULL,
  name varchar(255) NOT NULL,
  PRIMARY KEY (fid),
  FOREIGN KEY (user_id) REFERENCES login_u (user_id) ON DELETE CASCADE
)"></textarea></div>
		</div>
		<div class=row>
			<div class="col-12">备注:</div>
		</div>
		<div class=row>
			<div class="col-12"><input type=text class="form-control" name=table_comment placeholder="可留空白"></div>
		</div>
		<div class=row>
			<div class="col-6"></div>
			<div class="col-6"><button type=submit class="btn btn-primary"> 提交 </button></div>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="col-6">
<!--
<h5>说明:</h5>
在SQL表格生成里，只需输入原始生成语句里括号部分。比如原始生成语句是：
<pre><code>CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS my_friend (
  fid int unsigned NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,
  user_id int unsigned NOT NULL,
  name varchar(255) NOT NULL,
  PRIMARY KEY (fid),
  FOREIGN KEY (user_id) REFERENCES login_u (user_id) ON DELETE CASCADE
) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8;</code></pre>
那么你用 <em>my_friend</em> 作为表格名称。语句栏目里，输入：
<pre><code>(
  fid int unsigned NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,
  user_id int unsigned NOT NULL,
  name varchar(255) NOT NULL,
  PRIMARY KEY (fid),
  FOREIGN KEY (user_id) REFERENCES login_u (user_id) ON DELETE CASCADE
)</code></pre>
你需要把开头的 <em>CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS my_friend</em> 和结尾 <em>ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8</em> 去掉。
-->
	</div>
</div>

</form>

[% INCLUDE end.gb %]
